__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Source drawings are large binaries supplied per project, not repo content.
data/*.pdf
data/*.xlsx

# Viewer page backdrops are regenerated from the PDF by
# `spike/detect_valves.py --viewer out/viewer`; only the overlay data and the
# viewer itself are repo content.
out/viewer/*.png

# Runtime state: uploads, SQLite, generated workbooks.
app/_data/

# Packaging output and the date stamp `build.bat` writes into the build.  The
# stamp is generated, never committed: a checked-in build date would claim a
# release that never happened.
build/
dist/
app/_build.json

# The client's lists, normalised.  Derived from data/*.xlsx and therefore the
# same client material those are gitignored for - it stays on the machine that
# made it.  Rebuild with the round's parser when it is needed.
out/alnouf1_truth.csv

# Blank forms, made from the client's workbooks by `python3 -m app.forms`.
# Emptied of data but still the client's form, so they stay out like the
# workbooks they came from.
data/blank/

# Round measurements that transcribe the client's own lists - the same client
# material `data/*.xlsx` is gitignored for, only rearranged.  `page_diff.xlsx`
# carries the client's per-drawing counts and its VALVE TYPE column;
# `description_identifiability.md` carries 385 of its Description sentences
# verbatim.  Rebuild them from `data/` when they are needed.
out/page_diff.xlsx
out/description_identifiability.md

# 5회차 라벨링 워크북 — 발주처 문장(FN 시트)이 들어 있어 리포에 넣지 않음
out/label_nouf1.xlsx
out/candidates_nouf1.xlsx

# 회사 PC 이관용 Windows 휠 (75MB) — 저장소에 담지 않습니다.
# 만드는 법: docs/offline_setup_windows.md · docs/transfer_manifest.md
wheels/

# TC2 분석 결과 json — 발주처 도면의 텍스트가 그대로 들어갑니다 (도면 자체는
# `data/*.pdf` 규칙이 이미 막습니다).  측정 스크립트는 커밋합니다.
out/tc2/*.json
out/tc2/*.png
out/regression_3p/
out/round23/ui_db/
out/round23/tests.done

# 24회차 — UI 스위트용 DB(발주처 행 1037개)와 도면 렌더.  측정 로그와 보고서는
# 커밋하고, 도면 그림과 행 데이터는 담지 않는다 (`data/*.pdf` 와 같은 이유).
out/round24/ui.db
out/round24/7_캡처/*.png
out/round24/verify/*.png
